{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search companies by name"},"description":"Find companies by name in the official registers of France, Spain and United Kingdom, 10 per page.\nUse it when you know a name but no ID, then call lookup_company or verify_company with an ID from the results. Don't use it when you already have an official ID.\nInputs: country FR or ES or GB; query, 2 to 200 characters ('telefonica'). Optional: postal_code, locality, status, jurisdiction (regional registers), page, format; limit (up to 100 rows) with a file format.\nReturns: best match first, each with match.score (0-1) and reasons, name, status, address, IDs, provenance; meta.next_page.\nLimits: 2 units a page; files 2 per started 25 rows. Read-only. France: insolvency from BODACC since 2008. BODACC events and dated capital. Public contracts won since 2024 (DECP, weekly). Spain: BORME acts since 2 January 2009. Every BORME act as an event. UK: no officers or PSCs. ISINs and BICs from GLEIF, by LEI. No person's name in any answer.\nSearch words: SIREN, RCS, Annuaire des Entreprises, soci\u00e9t\u00e9; BORME, Registro Mercantil, empresa, sociedad; Companies House, company number, Ltd, plc, LLP, KYB, supplier check.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"country":{"description":"ISO country code: FR or ES or GB.","enum":["FR","ES","GB"],"examples":["FR"],"title":"Country","type":"string"},"format":{"default":"json","description":"Answer format: json (default); csv, tsv, markdown, html (table), xml or ndjson come back inline, one row per company with source and fetched_at; xlsx or parquet as a download link valid 24 hours. Same units; search takes limit (up to 100 rows) with a non-json format.","enum":["json","csv","tsv","xlsx","markdown","html","xml","ndjson","parquet"],"examples":["csv"],"title":"Format","type":"string"},"jurisdiction":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"description":"Optional ISO 